{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2020b.q29.material.recovered", "text": "某校初二（3）班共40人，男16人，女24人教材内容：健美操基本动作，单元教学计划共6课时第1课时：课的前半部分：教师根据需要随机将学生分为5个小组，在小组中选出一位组长，前半节课讲解本次课的教学目标、教学内容，让学生了解整个过程。课的后半部分：在教师指导下进行手臂方位与身体步法基本动作学练。2～3课时：教师对全班进行手臂方法组合、身体步法组合、跳步组合讲解示范。集体练习后分小组练习。4课时：各小组自主练习，互相帮助，教师指导5课时：借助视频辅助手段，结合录像进行练习，小组成员观看视频练习。练习结束后，各组人员参赛，参赛人数不限，可自配音乐。6课时：比赛后，小组总体进行讨论，由组长在全班交流，老师结合进行总结发言。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a3f8fd78b4d309da16400d190ff3c9c96ca7e485ebea762e8223d7b1b87c9b29", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2366, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2677, "next_source_question_number": 39, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "a3f8fd78b4d309da16400d190ff3c9c96ca7e485ebea762e8223d7b1b87c9b29"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2020b.q29"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s3.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s3.k02", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s4.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.design", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.313.r017", "ntce.outline.313.r018", "ntce.outline.313.r021"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2020b.q29"], "word_count": 311, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a3f8fd78b4d309da16400d190ff3c9c96ca7e485ebea762e8223d7b1b87c9b29", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2366, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2677, "next_source_question_number": 39, "alignment_status": "unique