{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2020b.q30.material.recovered", "text": "初二（3）班蹲踞式跳远第二节课，张老师带领学生做了6节徒手操，并进行腾空步示范。开始安排两组学生在同一个沙坑进行快速助跑“腾空步”练习，李华摔倒了并说：老师我脚崴了，不能再练了。老师将李华送到医务室处理。李华同学问：老师，我已经崴脚好几次了，为什么总是朝外崴？（注：韧带撕裂位置在脚踝外侧）", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a3f8fd78b4d309da16400d190ff3c9c96ca7e485ebea762e8223d7b1b87c9b29", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2737, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2882, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "a3f8fd78b4d309da16400d190ff3c9c96ca7e485ebea762e8223d7b1b87c9b29"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2020b.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k03", "ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.s1.k04"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.313.r003", "ntce.outline.313.r004"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.tiyu.2020b.q30"], "word_count": 145, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a3f8fd78b4d309da16400d190ff3c9c96ca7e485ebea762e8223d7b1b87c9b29", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2737, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2882, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《初中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "a3f8fd78b4d309da16400d190ff3c9c96ca7e485ebea762e8223d7b1b87